  "2026-09-04T21:05:47.197Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: Detect absent or incomplete history baselines before materialization and return the named history_baseline_unavailable refusal with recovery guidance. Missing-create and incomplete-baseline negative controls passed alongside complete update-baseline and compacted-baseline compatibility cases. Full repository tests and error-contract checks passed. Repository-wide exact 100/100/100/100 coverage and pnpm quality:static passed without weakening thresholds. All changed surfaces are linked to canonical delivery items. Hosted PR review and merged-main operational verification are pending and must pass before merge; the already published 2026.9.4 artifact does not contain this branch."
